      "pageEnd": 17,
      "target": "../sections/page-017.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "15.\t Mazanderani AH, Technau K-G, Hsiao N-Y, Maritz J, \nCarmona S, Sherman GG. Recommendations for the \nmanagement of indeterminate HIV PCR results within \nSouth Africa’s early infant diagnosis programme. \nSouthern African Journal of HIV Medicine. 2016;17(1):1-5.\n16.\t Dunning L, Francke JA, Mallampati D, MacLean RL, \nPenazzato M, Hou T, et al. The value of confirmatory \ntesting in early infant HIV diagnosis programmes \nin South Africa: A cost-effectiveness analysis. PLoS \nMedicine. 2017;14(11):e1002446.\n17.\t WHO. WHO list of prequalified in vitro diagnostic \nproducts. Geneva: World Health Orga",
